      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "究竟发生了什么事？\n拥有目白之名的赛马娘的资质，\n传承到了目白光明身上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a83994cb8fd2cbbfbe030cff0b579b5f3b36d797f319cbaa08ee16ff587fd0da",
